(149626, 7712, 4005, '<td valign="top">But the horseshoe must hang the other way round or it all the luck will fall out of it *smile* I didn''t know your gesture - does it work? Good luck (hang the horseshoe right...) 7 - KAOS</td>', 'But the horseshoe must hang the other way round or it all the luck will fall out of it *smile* I didn''t know your gesture - does it work? Good luck (hang the horseshoe right...) 7 - KAOS', '2002-11-04 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
