(149653, 7719, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot.  I think it would have been better if the Jack O lantern wasn''t so darn happy.  It may have worked better without him entirely.  DPz</td>', 'Pretty nice shot.  I think it would have been better if the Jack O lantern wasn''t so darn happy.  It may have worked better without him entirely.  DPz', '2002-11-04 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149654, 7719, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- very nice lighting setup, just the candle is a bit blown out. <br/>composition -- personally, i find the pumkin doesn''t fit in with the rest of objects, to cheery/cheesy/commercial holiday.  the glittery things in the foreground aren''t discernible, i think i would prefer a plain black background or have them more recognizable.  i very much like the arrangement of the other items, you obviously put a lot of thought into them.  nice dynamic.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- very nice lighting setup, just the candle is a bit blown out. composition -- personally, i find the pumkin doesn''t fit in with the rest of objects, to cheery/cheesy/commercial holiday.  the glittery things in the foreground aren''t discernible, i think i would prefer a plain black background or have them more recognizable.  i very much like the arrangement of the other items, you obviously put a lot of thought into them.  nice dynamic.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-05 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
