(149658, 7719, 2764, '<td valign="top">The cheezy glitter pumpkin adds nothing and detracts a lot.  take it away. then you can change the camera angle up a bit so the page in the book shows and the necklace.  Could be a much better picture, the elements are all there. 6</td>', 'The cheezy glitter pumpkin adds nothing and detracts a lot.  take it away. then you can change the camera angle up a bit so the page in the book shows and the necklace.  Could be a much better picture, the elements are all there. 6', '2002-11-08 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
