(149679, 7721, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but unless I''m incorrect, a 4 leaf clover is good luck, not a 3 leaf.  A 4 leaf you give it away and a 5 leaf, you keep.  I actually have a 5 leaf clover.  5 for the challenge 10 for the photo quality  makes a 7.5 over all score.</td>', 'Cute idea but unless I''m incorrect, a 4 leaf clover is good luck, not a 3 leaf.  A 4 leaf you give it away and a 5 leaf, you keep.  I actually have a 5 leaf clover.  5 for the challenge 10 for the photo quality  makes a 7.5 over all score.', '2002-11-06 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
