(149683, 7721, 4162, '<td valign="top">Of all the salt pictures, this is my favourite. The colours and contrast are strong which adds impact. Needs to be one extra leaf on the clover though!</td>', 'Of all the salt pictures, this is my favourite. The colours and contrast are strong which adds impact. Needs to be one extra leaf on the clover though!', '2002-11-10 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149684, 7721, 4829, '<td valign="top">Just to address a couple of things :O) The "interesting blue stripe" is salt. The shaker is translucent. I couldn''t find a four leaf clover, didn''t want to fake one, but I figured that it would pass either way, thank to those that left constuctive comments. I realize that there were several, ''salt'' photos, and "Yeah" I am sure that there were not 10, however I guess you need to look at the differences betweent he photos not JUST the subject. I am satisfied with how well it did though!</td>', 'Just to address a couple of things :O) The "interesting blue stripe" is salt. The shaker is translucent. I couldn''t find a four leaf clover, didn''t want to fake one, but I figured that it would pass either way, thank to those that left constuctive comments. I realize that there were several, ''salt'' photos, and "Yeah" I am sure that there were not 10, however I guess you need to look at the differences betweent he photos not JUST the subject. I am satisfied with how well it did though!', '2002-11-11 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
