(149822, 7731, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- you managed to get the reflection in focus, more than i achieved when i tried this kind of shot.  good job.<br/>compostition -- personally, i feel there''s too much ''wasted'' space.  maybe have more of the person reflect in the mirror pieces and less of the concrete floor.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- you managed to get the reflection in focus, more than i achieved when i tried this kind of shot.  good job.compostition -- personally, i feel there''s too much ''wasted'' space.  maybe have more of the person reflect in the mirror pieces and less of the concrete floor.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-08 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
