(149861, 7733, 4005, '<td valign="top">Did you buy next years calendar just for this challenge?<br/>I like the blue in this shot and I tried to figure out, what''s that for a shadow over the whole picture, but I gave up... however, it''s a good idea... I wish you luck for this challenge, 7 - KAOS.</td>', 'Did you buy next years calendar just for this challenge?I like the blue in this shot and I tried to figure out, what''s that for a shadow over the whole picture, but I gave up... however, it''s a good idea... I wish you luck for this challenge, 7 - KAOS.', '2002-11-10 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
