(149926, 7739, 2221, '<td valign="top">Many thanks for your feedback. As usual please see the photo details how I did this. I see more and more positive comments. While I like that of course, please don''t be shy with your criticism. I can take it :-)<br/>Personally I liked the glow effect and (at least to me) it looks like an x-ray radiograph. That''s why I titled it _revealed_ lie, because x-rays can reveal what otherwise cannot be seen.</td>', 'Many thanks for your feedback. As usual please see the photo details how I did this. I see more and more positive comments. While I like that of course, please don''t be shy with your criticism. I can take it :-)Personally I liked the glow effect and (at least to me) it looks like an x-ray radiograph. That''s why I titled it _revealed_ lie, because x-rays can reveal what otherwise cannot be seen.', '2002-11-11 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
