(149937, 7740, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot.  If it wasn''t for the title, I wouldn''t have understood it. I''m learning a lot of superstitions this week!  I think this shot need ssomething more dramatic to really finish it off.  The bowl seems to be slightly off center in the frame, to hurt the composition a bit.  The bottom of the table being visible (ie. I can see "under the table") is a bit distracting.  Maybe a different perspective could really finish this shot off, or maybe just a tighter verticaly crop would be cool?  -   JB</td>', 'This is a neat shot.  If it wasn''t for the title, I wouldn''t have understood it. I''m learning a lot of superstitions this week!  I think this shot need ssomething more dramatic to really finish it off.  The bowl seems to be slightly off center in the frame, to hurt the composition a bit.  The bottom of the table being visible (ie. I can see "under the table") is a bit distracting.  Maybe a different perspective could really finish this shot off, or maybe just a tighter verticaly crop would be cool?  -   JB', '2002-11-06 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
