(149962, 7741, 4648, '<td valign="top">Every one wants one of these beside their money tree.  Beautiful nature photo.  Love the ground stone work against the different colors of green in the back ground.  Love the way it is framed on the right as you look at it.  A beautiful setting well photographed.  A good STRONG 9.  Would have liked to have seen a little more sky at the top to finish it off for a 10.</td>', 'Every one wants one of these beside their money tree.  Beautiful nature photo.  Love the ground stone work against the different colors of green in the back ground.  Love the way it is framed on the right as you look at it.  A beautiful setting well photographed.  A good STRONG 9.  Would have liked to have seen a little more sky at the top to finish it off for a 10.', '2002-11-09 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149963, 7742, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice story told.  I wouldn''t have thought of putting it over the bed.  DPz</td>', 'Nice story told.  I wouldn''t have thought of putting it over the bed.  DPz', '2002-11-04 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149964, 7742, 4493, '<td valign="top">Shot is a little dark, a little more light on the suject would be nice. DOF is good. Composition is good.</td>', 'Shot is a little dark, a little more light on the suject would be nice. DOF is good. Composition is good.', '2002-11-04 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149965, 7742, 2764, '<td valign="top">aha! it loaded today.  Almost makes it.  The asian characters on the pillow(?) are distracting and confuse the native american theme, makes te picture busy.  The curtains are lovley and the mood is dreamy but the dreamcatcher could have been lowered so it is framed in the white headbord curtan and not half lost in the shadow.  otherwise the lighting is nice. 7</td>', 'aha! it loaded today.  Almost makes it.  The asian characters on the pillow(?) are distracting and confuse the native american theme, makes te picture busy.  The curtains are lovley and the mood is dreamy but the dreamcatcher could have been lowered so it is framed in the white headbord curtan and not half lost in the shadow.  otherwise the lighting is nice. 7', '2002-11-04 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149966, 7742, 3317, '<td valign="top">like the two light sources.</td>', 'like the two light sources.', '2002-11-04 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149967, 7742, 4764, '<td valign="top">Very good use of lighting, and color composition.<br/><br/>7<br/>Hector</td>', 'Very good use of lighting, and color composition.7Hector', '2002-11-04 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149968, 7742, 2716, '<td valign="top">Is that what they call a dream catcher?  I like it. 6  Jacko</td>', 'Is that what they call a dream catcher?  I like it. 6  Jacko', '2002-11-04 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149969, 7742, 3724, '<td valign="top">A real room, real dream catcher......  interesting framing with the lace.<br/></td>', 'A real room, real dream catcher......  interesting framing with the lace.', '2002-11-04 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149970, 7742, 4596, '<td valign="top">Good theme. I like this. Something about a native dream catcher in juxtaposition with the Asian writing...</td>', 'Good theme. I like this. Something about a native dream catcher in juxtaposition with the Asian writing...', '2002-11-05 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149971, 7742, 4536, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting. I think better framing of the dream catcher(so there wasn''t a line running through it) would have made this a stronger shot.</td>', 'interesting lighting. I think better framing of the dream catcher(so there wasn''t a line running through it) would have made this a stronger shot.', '2002-11-05 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149972, 7742, 4575, '<td valign="top">I like the blue lighting (UV?;)), prehaps an extra light on the subject itself could have enhanced the shot.</td>', 'I like the blue lighting (UV?;)), prehaps an extra light on the subject itself could have enhanced the shot.', '2002-11-07 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149973, 7742, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that you had something running horizontally thru the middle of the dream catcher.  It is really distracting.  We lose the continuity of the piece. - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t like that you had something running horizontally thru the middle of the dream catcher.  It is really distracting.  We lose the continuity of the piece. - Inspzil', '2002-11-08 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
