(149978, 7743, 4829, '<td valign="top">Nice in black in white, however I think would have been nicer in color, with the contrast of the salt and the wood mill. Just my opinion, but nice picture...-7-</td>', 'Nice in black in white, however I think would have been nicer in color, with the contrast of the salt and the wood mill. Just my opinion, but nice picture...-7-', '2002-11-04 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
