(150004, 7744, 811, '<td valign="top">How long did you have to sit and wait for the cat to run across the road?  :-)  karmat</td>', 'How long did you have to sit and wait for the cat to run across the road?  :-)  karmat', '2002-11-08 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150005, 7744, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!  Funny how the cat also just happens to be in a shadow!  Adds to the "dark" nature of the subject. Good diagonal lines, good exposure, and overall good composition.  Good luck! Grayce aka Gracious :-)</td>', 'Good job!  Funny how the cat also just happens to be in a shadow!  Adds to the "dark" nature of the subject. Good diagonal lines, good exposure, and overall good composition.  Good luck! Grayce aka Gracious :-)', '2002-11-09 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150006, 7744, 4455, '<td valign="top">i think IMHO you should have done a close shot, but there are nice colours in your photo-anz</td>', 'i think IMHO you should have done a close shot, but there are nice colours in your photo-anz', '2002-11-10 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150007, 7744, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good clear beautiful landscape photo.  Love the colors of the leaves and the country side.  But would have liked a little closer to the cat.  Funny how he was right in the middle of the shade.  I think that adds to it, intentional or not.  Good stong 7.</td>', 'Good clear beautiful landscape photo.  Love the colors of the leaves and the country side.  But would have liked a little closer to the cat.  Funny how he was right in the middle of the shade.  I think that adds to it, intentional or not.  Good stong 7.', '2002-11-10 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150008, 7744, 117, '<td valign="top">nice cat--i will usually turn my head or body or say the cat had white on him.</td>', 'nice cat--i will usually turn my head or body or say the cat had white on him.', '2002-11-11 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(150009, 7745, 4077, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I like the somewhat harsh lighting and the reflections in the glass, but as a minor point the cards in the background look a bit staged. seasick - 8.</td>', 'Excellent shot. I like the somewhat harsh lighting and the reflections in the glass, but as a minor point the cards in the background look a bit staged. seasick - 8.', '2002-11-04 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150010, 7745, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good compostition. Nice reflection in the glass.</td>', 'Good compostition. Nice reflection in the glass.', '2002-11-04 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150011, 7745, 2716, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard of that one before.  Something about a cowboy shot in the back.  Nice composition.  8  Jacko</td>', 'I''ve heard of that one before.  Something about a cowboy shot in the back.  Nice composition.  8  Jacko', '2002-11-04 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150012, 7745, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice detail here, I especially like the reflection in the booze.</td>', 'nice detail here, I especially like the reflection in the booze.', '2002-11-05 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150013, 7745, 4100, '<td valign="top">Good job - well composed and lit. Very strong image - well done.</td>', 'Good job - well composed and lit. Very strong image - well done.', '2002-11-05 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150014, 7745, 1273, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Love the cards in the glass.</td>', 'Interesting image.  Love the cards in the glass.', '2002-11-05 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150015, 7745, 3167, '<td valign="top">This would be a lot better if there really were three 8s.</td>', 'This would be a lot better if there really were three 8s.', '2002-11-06 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150016, 7745, 4411, '<td valign="top">Don''t know this superstition - looks like there''s a few variations on it though. Nice picture, front card is maybe too bright &amp; featureless, bonus points if that''s Jack Daniels in the glass!</td>', 'Don''t know this superstition - looks like there''s a few variations on it though. Nice picture, front card is maybe too bright & featureless, bonus points if that''s Jack Daniels in the glass!', '2002-11-07 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150017, 7745, 2706, '<td valign="top">nice setup. The cup really adds to the picture.</td>', 'nice setup. The cup really adds to the picture.', '2002-11-07 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150018, 7745, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks sort of washed out on the cards.  Maybe a bit oversharpened or shot at too high an ISO or compression probs.  Just doesn''t quite look right though.  Nice idea - Good luck, Inspzil</td>', 'Looks sort of washed out on the cards.  Maybe a bit oversharpened or shot at too high an ISO or compression probs.  Just doesn''t quite look right though.  Nice idea - Good luck, Inspzil', '2002-11-08 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150019, 7745, 3981, '<td valign="top">Artistically and technically very good.  I like the reflection in the glass of the background cards.  That''s a bonus to an already good shot.  10.  Bitz</td>', 'Artistically and technically very good.  I like the reflection in the glass of the background cards.  That''s a bonus to an already good shot.  10.  Bitz', '2002-11-08 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150020, 7745, 4648, '<td valign="top">Verily interesting.  Good sharp cards and even greater cards in the drink.  This is really verily interesting....right up to a 7 on the interesting alone.</td>', 'Verily interesting.  Good sharp cards and even greater cards in the drink.  This is really verily interesting....right up to a 7 on the interesting alone.', '2002-11-09 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150021, 7748, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the pumpkin. The composition seems a bit off.  Perhaps too much space at the bottom.  DPz</td>', 'Nice job on the pumpkin. The composition seems a bit off.  Perhaps too much space at the bottom.  DPz', '2002-11-04 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150022, 7748, 3900, '<td valign="top">Awesome carving!</td>', 'Awesome carving!', '2002-11-04 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150023, 7748, 4615, '<td valign="top">Good carving.</td>', 'Good carving.', '2002-11-04 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150024, 7748, 4493, '<td valign="top">Only thing that may have helped keep the focus on the pumpkin is to have a solid background. The bricks and other background object distract the viewer. Focus is a little fuzzy around the cat. Good use of lighting.</td>', 'Only thing that may have helped keep the focus on the pumpkin is to have a solid background. The bricks and other background object distract the viewer. Focus is a little fuzzy around the cat. Good use of lighting.', '2002-11-04 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
