(150035, 7748, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand it but this one actually looked better and clearer as a thumbnail.  I liked it as a thumbnail but don''t bull size.  It is not nearly as clear and easy to see the cat .  I can tell some time and effort went into setting this up.  But I can''t give it more than a 5 and that is based on the thumbnail.</td>', 'I don''t understand it but this one actually looked better and clearer as a thumbnail.  I liked it as a thumbnail but don''t bull size.  It is not nearly as clear and easy to see the cat .  I can tell some time and effort went into setting this up.  But I can''t give it more than a 5 and that is based on the thumbnail.', '2002-11-10 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150036, 7748, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very cool pumpkin - that must have been a lot of work! lhall</td>', 'Very cool pumpkin - that must have been a lot of work! lhall', '2002-11-10 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150037, 7749, 4267, '<td valign="top">the photo does''t do a lot for me, but it was done with superior focus and lighting. great technique.</td>', 'the photo does''t do a lot for me, but it was done with superior focus and lighting. great technique.', '2002-11-04 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150038, 7749, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  The color is good althought the face seems a bit washed out.  I wonder how many times you took this and how much salt you had to clean up??  DPz</td>', 'Nice job.  The color is good althought the face seems a bit washed out.  I wonder how many times you took this and how much salt you had to clean up??  DPz', '2002-11-04 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150039, 7749, 4306, '<td valign="top">Great capture</td>', 'Great capture', '2002-11-04 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150040, 7749, 3730, '<td valign="top">this would have been super awesome if you had gottent the salt on the black background instead of in front of her hair....still a very nice shot - zadore</td>', 'this would have been super awesome if you had gottent the salt on the black background instead of in front of her hair....still a very nice shot - zadore', '2002-11-04 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150041, 7749, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  Don''t know how many tries it took you to get the "sea horse" but it is beautiful.  The colors are so natural, so real.  I love the blue eyes.  I would have croppeda little more from behind her.  The empty space detracts from what you have.  It is close to a 10 before taking off for the crop.  It is so important to me that I can''t give more than an 8 overall score.......which is a really GOOD score in itself.  Looked at it again and again and decided to change to a 9.PTL</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  Don''t know how many tries it took you to get the "sea horse" but it is beautiful.  The colors are so natural, so real.  I love the blue eyes.  I would have croppeda little more from behind her.  The empty space detracts from what you have.  It is close to a 10 before taking off for the crop.  It is so important to me that I can''t give more than an 8 overall score.......which is a really GOOD score in itself.  Looked at it again and again and decided to change to a 9.PTL', '2002-11-04 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150042, 7749, 4615, '<td valign="top">This could be a winner this week.  (sadly, thats not saying much.)  like the red sweater, clear eyes.  How much salt was used in the process!</td>', 'This could be a winner this week.  (sadly, thats not saying much.)  like the red sweater, clear eyes.  How much salt was used in the process!', '2002-11-04 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150043, 7749, 4472, '<td valign="top">Very well captured,  a closer crop may have been better. Isn''t it over left shoulder with right hand however ?</td>', 'Very well captured,  a closer crop may have been better. Isn''t it over left shoulder with right hand however ?', '2002-11-04 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150044, 7749, 2792, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  Captured the salt perfectly.  =-p  9/10!</td>', 'Great photo!  Captured the salt perfectly.  =-p  9/10!', '2002-11-04 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150045, 7749, 3317, '<td valign="top">only one of the salt pictures that had a person throwing it i''ve seen (so far), you get a ten.</td>', 'only one of the salt pictures that had a person throwing it i''ve seen (so far), you get a ten.', '2002-11-04 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
