(150064, 7749, 2706, '<td valign="top">a good idea - especially with the area of blackness on the left. Makes it kind of look like she''s thwoing the salt into nothingness. I would do one thing to make it better though. That is, i would have tried to time the shot so the hand was a little further back, allowing you to see more of the women''s face. Other than that, great shot :)<br/><br/>---- brandon (po)</td>', 'a good idea - especially with the area of blackness on the left. Makes it kind of look like she''s thwoing the salt into nothingness. I would do one thing to make it better though. That is, i would have tried to time the shot so the hand was a little further back, allowing you to see more of the women''s face. Other than that, great shot :)---- brandon (po)', '2002-11-08 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
