(150131, 7755, 2706, '<td valign="top">nice setup. The spilt salt and upright pepper make a great contrast for each other. Also, the nodescript background only makes the picture better by bringing attention the the salt and pepper shakers.</td>', 'nice setup. The spilt salt and upright pepper make a great contrast for each other. Also, the nodescript background only makes the picture better by bringing attention the the salt and pepper shakers.', '2002-11-07 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
