(150154, 7757, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot for this challenge. This shot has a lot of potential!  Personally, I feel that the background (everything outside of the drop) is somewhat distracting.  Perhaps a tight vertical crop would have worked well.  Or maybe shooting from closer, concentrating on the cross, the picture, etc. from a lower perspective?  Just ideas... Nice shot, well executed.  -   JB</td>', 'This is a good shot for this challenge. This shot has a lot of potential!  Personally, I feel that the background (everything outside of the drop) is somewhat distracting.  Perhaps a tight vertical crop would have worked well.  Or maybe shooting from closer, concentrating on the cross, the picture, etc. from a lower perspective?  Just ideas... Nice shot, well executed.  -   JB', '2002-11-06 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150155, 7757, 4648, '<td valign="top">You use different colors than I would choose.  Photo wise it is technically good - clear, good cropping even though closer than I like personally, very representative  for your culture.  Could be from a text book.  Definite 9 technically</td>', 'You use different colors than I would choose.  Photo wise it is technically good - clear, good cropping even though closer than I like personally, very representative  for your culture.  Could be from a text book.  Definite 9 technically', '2002-11-10 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
