(150237, 7763, 5028, '<td valign="top">Strange.  Very very strange.</td>', 'Strange.  Very very strange.', '2002-11-04 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150238, 7763, 4596, '<td valign="top">And how did you get this guys skin to be green? Good twist on theme. Not sure it''s an urban legend just yet. Perhaps it should be.</td>', 'And how did you get this guys skin to be green? Good twist on theme. Not sure it''s an urban legend just yet. Perhaps it should be.', '2002-11-05 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150239, 7763, 3532, '<td valign="top">I like the use of flash in this photo.  The harsh shadows and bright light give it kind of a feeling of being "caught" in the act or "caught on film"  Fun idea too.</td>', 'I like the use of flash in this photo.  The harsh shadows and bright light give it kind of a feeling of being "caught" in the act or "caught on film"  Fun idea too.', '2002-11-06 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150240, 7763, 4615, '<td valign="top">smooth retilian  head and then hairy human arms?  the model could have worn long sleeves, (lycra would have been great) Or if really committed to DPC; shaved.</td>', 'smooth retilian  head and then hairy human arms?  the model could have worn long sleeves, (lycra would have been great) Or if really committed to DPC; shaved.', '2002-11-06 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150241, 7763, 4049, '<td valign="top">?!?!?!  That''s a very good alien costume</td>', '?!?!?!  That''s a very good alien costume', '2002-11-06 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150242, 7763, 4648, '<td valign="top">Never heard of it.  Don''t know where to see the details.  But this is an awesome picture.  Sharp, clear, crisp features and colors.  Juts plain ole good niner picture</td>', 'Never heard of it.  Don''t know where to see the details.  But this is an awesome picture.  Sharp, clear, crisp features and colors.  Juts plain ole good niner picture', '2002-11-08 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150243, 7763, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the green on the arms, to be perfectly honest, it doesn''t quite look right.  There''s some on the right arm that appears to be worn off onto the shirt, or floating in mid air.  Also, on the left arm, it looks like only one little stripe of green.  I am taking your word for it that''s its not a post processing edit job, but still looks a bit strange.  I like the superstition very much, and the set up is great.  lighting and focus are ok, and the framing/cropping are good as well. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Not sure about the green on the arms, to be perfectly honest, it doesn''t quite look right.  There''s some on the right arm that appears to be worn off onto the shirt, or floating in mid air.  Also, on the left arm, it looks like only one little stripe of green.  I am taking your word for it that''s its not a post processing edit job, but still looks a bit strange.  I like the superstition very much, and the set up is great.  lighting and focus are ok, and the framing/cropping are good as well. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-09 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150244, 7764, 2279, '<td valign="top">Great idea...little too dark. byetko.</td>', 'Great idea...little too dark. byetko.', '2002-11-04 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150245, 7764, 4829, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, not to sure about the execution. I remember this ''urban legend''  though :O) Photo would have been better with a little more lite to show off the colors. Creativity is there though... -6-</td>', 'Nice concept, not to sure about the execution. I remember this ''urban legend''  though :O) Photo would have been better with a little more lite to show off the colors. Creativity is there though... -6-', '2002-11-04 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
