(150268, 7764, 4648, '<td valign="top">Why am I still alive.  I ate many a pack of pop rocks with sodas.  Needs a little more light, especially on the pop rocks and their packagte.  The coke can and soda foam can stand alone.  Not everyone knows what pop rocks are.  This will cost you a couple of points.  But then 8 is enough</td>', 'Why am I still alive.  I ate many a pack of pop rocks with sodas.  Needs a little more light, especially on the pop rocks and their packagte.  The coke can and soda foam can stand alone.  Not everyone knows what pop rocks are.  This will cost you a couple of points.  But then 8 is enough', '2002-11-10 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150269, 7766, 3273, '<td valign="top">Ah I get it!  I must admit I had to look the word up in the dictionary though.  12 cans, didn''t want 13 as it''s unlucky.<br/><br/>The cans look fine but I feel that there''s something missing from the ice and the black background.  The ice looks dull, almost unreal and the black background does nothing for me.  The cans themselves are okay though!!</td>', 'Ah I get it!  I must admit I had to look the word up in the dictionary though.  12 cans, didn''t want 13 as it''s unlucky.The cans look fine but I feel that there''s something missing from the ice and the black background.  The ice looks dull, almost unreal and the black background does nothing for me.  The cans themselves are okay though!!', '2002-11-04 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150270, 7766, 888, '<td valign="top">thanks to google I now know Triskaidekaphobia<br/> is the fear of 13, I''m not sure where pepsi comes in to it, well taken though<br/></td>', 'thanks to google I now know Triskaidekaphobia is the fear of 13, I''m not sure where pepsi comes in to it, well taken though', '2002-11-04 06:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150271, 7766, 4829, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to portray the fear of 13! Very creative :O)</td>', 'Interesting way to portray the fear of 13! Very creative :O)', '2002-11-04 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150272, 7766, 2535, '<td valign="top">what does ''pepsi'' have to do with Triskaidekaphobia?</td>', 'what does ''pepsi'' have to do with Triskaidekaphobia?', '2002-11-04 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150273, 7766, 772, '<td valign="top">ok.. i had to look it up :)  I would love to have seen this shot with some more creative lighting... the on camera flash rarely creates interesting lighting in a photograph.  The composition and theme of this shot are ok, but the color of these cans just bugs me :)  i don''t know what it is about the color, but a nice bright red coke can against the ics would give some better contrast, and probably work better with the on camera flash also :) - setzler</td>', 'ok.. i had to look it up :)  I would love to have seen this shot with some more creative lighting... the on camera flash rarely creates interesting lighting in a photograph.  The composition and theme of this shot are ok, but the color of these cans just bugs me :)  i don''t know what it is about the color, but a nice bright red coke can against the ics would give some better contrast, and probably work better with the on camera flash also :) - setzler', '2002-11-04 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150274, 7766, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Fun shot, great color. Justine</td>', 'lol Fun shot, great color. Justine', '2002-11-04 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
