(150374, 7773, 4829, '<td valign="top">I am not sure where the superstition or urban legend is incorporated, but the phot is beautiful. I am a fan of color photographs, would have liked to seen this one in color, however the black and white brings out nice detail in the water and rocks. -7-</td>', 'I am not sure where the superstition or urban legend is incorporated, but the phot is beautiful. I am a fan of color photographs, would have liked to seen this one in color, however the black and white brings out nice detail in the water and rocks. -7-', '2002-11-04 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
