(150376, 7773, 2792, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, but what''s the superstition/urban legend?  Arrgh...this challenge is hard to vote for!  7/10, simply because I don''t know the superstition.  Sorry!  Will raise my vote if you let me know what it is.  erin_m02</td>', 'Very nice photo, but what''s the superstition/urban legend?  Arrgh...this challenge is hard to vote for!  7/10, simply because I don''t know the superstition.  Sorry!  Will raise my vote if you let me know what it is.  erin_m02', '2002-11-04 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
