(150378, 7773, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice shot, not sure if the cloud in front of the mtn. adds or detracts.<br/>is a bit tilted.<br/>nice tones and contrast in foreground, too bad that couldn''t be matched in the mtn. part of the shot. Gradient filter would have helped.</td>', 'nice shot, not sure if the cloud in front of the mtn. adds or detracts.is a bit tilted.nice tones and contrast in foreground, too bad that couldn''t be matched in the mtn. part of the shot. Gradient filter would have helped.', '2002-11-04 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150379, 7773, 1019, '<td valign="top">Why no colour?  andrewm</td>', 'Why no colour?  andrewm', '2002-11-04 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150380, 7773, 1003, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-11-05 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150381, 7773, 4402, '<td valign="top">I do not understand why you wanted this picture in black and white.</td>', 'I do not understand why you wanted this picture in black and white.', '2002-11-05 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150382, 7773, 4162, '<td valign="top">Just wondering where you took this from? Its a lovely picture, but a real shame that Fuji is hiding, hence the title "Immortal".  I live in Japan and went to Fuji last weekend, took some shots, now is the perfect time as Fuji is half covered in snow, shame we couldnt see that in your picture. I climbed Fuji this summer, something I wouldnt reccommend to anyone-very hard work!! Good Luck in the challenge.  Natasha</td>', 'Just wondering where you took this from? Its a lovely picture, but a real shame that Fuji is hiding, hence the title "Immortal".  I live in Japan and went to Fuji last weekend, took some shots, now is the perfect time as Fuji is half covered in snow, shame we couldnt see that in your picture. I climbed Fuji this summer, something I wouldnt reccommend to anyone-very hard work!! Good Luck in the challenge.  Natasha', '2002-11-05 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150383, 7773, 2716, '<td valign="top">Yeah, it''s a legend.  Why the Black and White?  I''d really like to see this scene in colour.  6 jacko.</td>', 'Yeah, it''s a legend.  Why the Black and White?  I''d really like to see this scene in colour.  6 jacko.', '2002-11-06 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150384, 7773, 2567, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this one in color..</td>', 'I would like to see this one in color..', '2002-11-08 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150385, 7773, 737, '<td valign="top">I just saw this on Tuesday, and it was snow capped. <br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'I just saw this on Tuesday, and it was snow capped. Jim msp', '2002-11-08 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150386, 7773, 1707, '<td valign="top">the mountain seems too faded, try a polarizer filter</td>', 'the mountain seems too faded, try a polarizer filter', '2002-11-09 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150387, 7773, 5058, '<td valign="top">VERY CLASSY black and white always is though :) I like it a bunch, what filters were used?</td>', 'VERY CLASSY black and white always is though :) I like it a bunch, what filters were used?', '2002-11-10 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
