(150390, 7773, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to take your word for it.  I''ve never been there.  Beautiful B &amp; W but I really would have prefered a color photo here.  It would have taken it from an 8 to a 10 in my eyes.  Sorry.</td>', 'I''ll have to take your word for it.  I''ve never been there.  Beautiful B & W but I really would have prefered a color photo here.  It would have taken it from an 8 to a 10 in my eyes.  Sorry.', '2002-11-10 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
