(150392, 7774, 4493, '<td valign="top">Seems to have had a lot of post work done on it. The white dots of the light would work better if they were centered on each eye.</td>', 'Seems to have had a lot of post work done on it. The white dots of the light would work better if they were centered on each eye.', '2002-11-04 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150393, 7774, 2764, '<td valign="top">sigh - I have a problem with pictures that won''t load 10 for now. I''ll come back tomorrow</td>', 'sigh - I have a problem with pictures that won''t load 10 for now. I''ll come back tomorrow', '2002-11-04 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150394, 7774, 772, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe I like the level of focus you chose for this shot... Personally, I wold rather see the detail on the cat''s face.  I am not sure where it came from, but the red, green, and blue dots are qute visible in the lighter areas of this photo, and it''s creating a distracting cross-hatch pattern for me... The concept of this photo is excellent and the composition is also very nice... my tastes just don''t care much for the presentation... - setzler</td>', 'I don''t believe I like the level of focus you chose for this shot... Personally, I wold rather see the detail on the cat''s face.  I am not sure where it came from, but the red, green, and blue dots are qute visible in the lighter areas of this photo, and it''s creating a distracting cross-hatch pattern for me... The concept of this photo is excellent and the composition is also very nice... my tastes just don''t care much for the presentation... - setzler', '2002-11-04 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150395, 7774, 1569, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too blurry,need something to focus on--no matter how small.</td>', 'Just a bit too blurry,need something to focus on--no matter how small.', '2002-11-04 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150396, 7774, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for this depiction of a black cat.  If it is out of focus on purpose, then I won''t tell you it''s grossly out of focus (I''m assuming it is on purpose).  - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t care for this depiction of a black cat.  If it is out of focus on purpose, then I won''t tell you it''s grossly out of focus (I''m assuming it is on purpose).  - Inspzil', '2002-11-05 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
