(150409, 7776, 1280, '<td valign="top">I thought of this one too....didn''t know if it was a universal kinda thing or just a thing from my nabe.  Now I know, unless.....hey are you from da Bronx???  LOL   I was very careful for years for fear of hurting Mama.  Well executed.  Good luck!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I thought of this one too....didn''t know if it was a universal kinda thing or just a thing from my nabe.  Now I know, unless.....hey are you from da Bronx???  LOL   I was very careful for years for fear of hurting Mama.  Well executed.  Good luck!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-05 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
