(150512, 7782, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, I will apologize if I don''t see this photo the same way you do.  I think it is suposed to represent an alien abduction, but I can''t tell what objects in this shot are at all.  It''s way too blurry to get detail out of anything.  While I realize you meant to do this, I think that there should be SOMETHING recognizable in the shot that makes us even remotely think that it could be an alien abduction.  Otherwise, this is just a blurry photo with little meaning to me.  Sorry that I''m not seeing it. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Well, I will apologize if I don''t see this photo the same way you do.  I think it is suposed to represent an alien abduction, but I can''t tell what objects in this shot are at all.  It''s way too blurry to get detail out of anything.  While I realize you meant to do this, I think that there should be SOMETHING recognizable in the shot that makes us even remotely think that it could be an alien abduction.  Otherwise, this is just a blurry photo with little meaning to me.  Sorry that I''m not seeing it. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-09 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
