(150656, 7795, 2923, '<td valign="top">I''ll be more impressed if it''s a real toad :)</td>', 'I''ll be more impressed if it''s a real toad :)', '2002-11-09 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150657, 7795, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty shot.  i think it has a dreamy feel to it.  The girls hair really adds to the "princess" kind of feel.  Cute frog.  I like how he stands out well on the background.  Nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This is a very pretty shot.  i think it has a dreamy feel to it.  The girls hair really adds to the "princess" kind of feel.  Cute frog.  I like how he stands out well on the background.  Nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-09 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150658, 7795, 4648, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a little lighter background but aok picture anyway.  Love the "frog" and how he looks like he is looking straight into her closed eyes.  He must be one handsome prince because he sure is an ugly frog.  Can I see the changed man?  If he''s good looking enough I might change my vote from a 6</td>', 'Would have liked a little lighter background but aok picture anyway.  Love the "frog" and how he looks like he is looking straight into her closed eyes.  He must be one handsome prince because he sure is an ugly frog.  Can I see the changed man?  If he''s good looking enough I might change my vote from a 6', '2002-11-09 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150659, 7795, 2221, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. First I thought that you should have chosen a different background, because the red hair of the girl merges with the colour of the wood. But the more I look at it, the more I think it actually works well. That way the green frog attracts the eye. -stephan</td>', 'Neat idea. First I thought that you should have chosen a different background, because the red hair of the girl merges with the colour of the wood. But the more I look at it, the more I think it actually works well. That way the green frog attracts the eye. -stephan', '2002-11-10 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150660, 7796, 4267, '<td valign="top">that one almost looks real!</td>', 'that one almost looks real!', '2002-11-04 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150661, 7796, 3273, '<td valign="top">"Six Days Of Searching!" and a bright red background.   Wooahhh!<br/><br/>Nicely framed subject but the background is a bit overpowering.</td>', '"Six Days Of Searching!" and a bright red background.   Wooahhh!Nicely framed subject but the background is a bit overpowering.', '2002-11-04 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150662, 7796, 4005, '<td valign="top">Heyyy - you got one! We didn''t... so I wish you all the luck (which you have now because of the shamrock!) for the challenge... 8 - KAOS<br/>p.s.: I like the red-green colorcontrast!</td>', 'Heyyy - you got one! We didn''t... so I wish you all the luck (which you have now because of the shamrock!) for the challenge... 8 - KAOSp.s.: I like the red-green colorcontrast!', '2002-11-04 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150663, 7796, 4493, '<td valign="top">Red seems a little washed out, other than that, good lighting and composition.</td>', 'Red seems a little washed out, other than that, good lighting and composition.', '2002-11-04 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150664, 7796, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting concept, but I think the red background is overpowering your subject... - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting concept, but I think the red background is overpowering your subject... - setzler', '2002-11-04 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150665, 7796, 4596, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. Why not now do something a bit more interesting with it?</td>', 'Congratulations. Why not now do something a bit more interesting with it?', '2002-11-05 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150666, 7796, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on your choice of background.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on your choice of background.', '2002-11-05 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150667, 7796, 4430, '<td valign="top">I think the red (way over saturated) background takes away from the subject (good subject) of the picture.</td>', 'I think the red (way over saturated) background takes away from the subject (good subject) of the picture.', '2002-11-06 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150668, 7796, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of background for this subject.  Provides a nice contrast.  The general picture is ok.  Not particularly strong composition.  You might have to look for 3 more days to find just the right one.  Well keep it close for good luck this week - Inspzil</td>', 'I like the choice of background for this subject.  Provides a nice contrast.  The general picture is ok.  Not particularly strong composition.  You might have to look for 3 more days to find just the right one.  Well keep it close for good luck this week - Inspzil', '2002-11-07 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150669, 7796, 4517, '<td valign="top">not sure about the red background</td>', 'not sure about the red background', '2002-11-09 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150670, 7796, 4648, '<td valign="top">6 days of hunting deserves a 6.  Very good close up of this.  Keep it for luck and give away a 5 leafed one for good luck to you and the receiver.</td>', '6 days of hunting deserves a 6.  Very good close up of this.  Keep it for luck and give away a 5 leafed one for good luck to you and the receiver.', '2002-11-09 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150671, 7796, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really don''t care for the red background! lhall</td>', 'I really don''t care for the red background! lhall', '2002-11-10 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150672, 7797, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great photo, and good idea, I like the sense of movement in it, it gives it a very real feel.  Nice Job!</td>', 'Great photo, and good idea, I like the sense of movement in it, it gives it a very real feel.  Nice Job!', '2002-11-04 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150673, 7797, 3018, '<td valign="top">Good motion effect.  Needs a little more focus.</td>', 'Good motion effect.  Needs a little more focus.', '2002-11-04 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150674, 7797, 2792, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge.  Great idea.  8/10</td>', 'Meets challenge.  Great idea.  8/10', '2002-11-04 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150675, 7797, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. Well done, good luck. Justine</td>', 'Neat shot. Well done, good luck. Justine', '2002-11-04 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150676, 7797, 4388, '<td valign="top">I like the way it looks like someone is knocking with the apparent movement.</td>', 'I like the way it looks like someone is knocking with the apparent movement.', '2002-11-04 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150677, 7797, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent concept, but I think it could''ve been executed a lot better, not that this is bad.  I think this would be better more exposed though, taken at a slightly different angle with more ''evidence'' of motion using a slower shutter speed.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'This is an excellent concept, but I think it could''ve been executed a lot better, not that this is bad.  I think this would be better more exposed though, taken at a slightly different angle with more ''evidence'' of motion using a slower shutter speed.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-05 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150678, 7797, 3932, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, and good idea for this challenge.  I think the shot would have a little more effect on me if I could see more motion.  Right now, to me it looks like a hand, and a ghost image of the hand, but not necessarily and "motion blur" since the hand itself is in good focus.  I hope that made sense :)  -  Good shot - 7 -  JB</td>', 'Neat shot, and good idea for this challenge.  I think the shot would have a little more effect on me if I could see more motion.  Right now, to me it looks like a hand, and a ghost image of the hand, but not necessarily and "motion blur" since the hand itself is in good focus.  I hope that made sense :)  -  Good shot - 7 -  JB', '2002-11-06 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150679, 7797, 5070, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well executed</td>', 'Good idea and well executed', '2002-11-06 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150680, 7797, 2125, '<td valign="top">nice motion shot</td>', 'nice motion shot', '2002-11-07 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150681, 7797, 5054, '<td valign="top">NO GUESSING ON THIS ONE. SIMPLE AND CLEAR.</td>', 'NO GUESSING ON THIS ONE. SIMPLE AND CLEAR.', '2002-11-09 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150682, 7797, 3416, '<td valign="top">pretty image, I like the effect of movement of the hand.</td>', 'pretty image, I like the effect of movement of the hand.', '2002-11-09 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150683, 7797, 4648, '<td valign="top">I really go for those that are one of a kind, especially if they show movement.  I like that in a photo.  Love the knot hole in the wood.  That makes the photo.  It adds at least 3 points for me.  The uniqueness adds 2 to 3 and you are already up to 5 or 6.  The know hole and everything else brings you up to 9.  It''s not a 10 bu a good 9</td>', 'I really go for those that are one of a kind, especially if they show movement.  I like that in a photo.  Love the knot hole in the wood.  That makes the photo.  It adds at least 3 points for me.  The uniqueness adds 2 to 3 and you are already up to 5 or 6.  The know hole and everything else brings you up to 9.  It''s not a 10 bu a good 9', '2002-11-10 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150684, 7797, 3402, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2002-11-10 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150685, 7797, 4467, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Picture.  The double exposure looks as if you are actually knocking</td>', 'Wonderful Picture.  The double exposure looks as if you are actually knocking', '2002-11-10 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150686, 7798, 3032, '<td valign="top">Might have been better with a more natural white balance.</td>', 'Might have been better with a more natural white balance.', '2002-11-04 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150687, 7798, 3890, '<td valign="top">Very creative,evokes an instant emotion..</td>', 'Very creative,evokes an instant emotion..', '2002-11-04 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150688, 7798, 4493, '<td valign="top">Composition is OK. I might have moved the knife handle down some and removed the two big drops of blood on the knife as they are distracting to the overall composition. Lighting OK.</td>', 'Composition is OK. I might have moved the knife handle down some and removed the two big drops of blood on the knife as they are distracting to the overall composition. Lighting OK.', '2002-11-04 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150689, 7798, 1827, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  I think it would work better without the fake blood, which isn''t realistic enough to be convincing.  Good luck.  5, just-married</td>', 'Good concept.  I think it would work better without the fake blood, which isn''t realistic enough to be convincing.  Good luck.  5, just-married', '2002-11-04 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150690, 7798, 843, '<td valign="top">Good setup, but unfortunately there''s a really bad color cast.</td>', 'Good setup, but unfortunately there''s a really bad color cast.', '2002-11-04 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150691, 7798, 4615, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  Only criticism is the knive looks a bit flat and dull.  it took about ten seconds to recognised it for what it was.  Play around with your lighting.   i expected more people to use tarot cards than did.  I wonder if the sniper in DC put people off?</td>', 'Good picture.  Only criticism is the knive looks a bit flat and dull.  it took about ten seconds to recognised it for what it was.  Play around with your lighting.   i expected more people to use tarot cards than did.  I wonder if the sniper in DC put people off?', '2002-11-05 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150692, 7798, 4753, '<td valign="top">the death card never means death....</td>', 'the death card never means death....', '2002-11-06 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150693, 7798, 205, '<td valign="top">that "blood" looks tasty like its fruit juce or something.</td>', 'that "blood" looks tasty like its fruit juce or something.', '2002-11-06 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150694, 7798, 5077, '<td valign="top">Wonder if it''d improve the picture with not quite such a heavy orange cast??  Was your white balance set appropriately??</td>', 'Wonder if it''d improve the picture with not quite such a heavy orange cast??  Was your white balance set appropriately??', '2002-11-07 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
