(150810, 7809, 4106, '<td valign="top">My wife was the one responsible for the other Neiman Marcus cookie shot in the challenge.  I told her nobody would get it and she should try something else, and now you have gone and given her the right to say "I told you so" all week.  I''ll try not to hold it against you.</td>', 'My wife was the one responsible for the other Neiman Marcus cookie shot in the challenge.  I told her nobody would get it and she should try something else, and now you have gone and given her the right to say "I told you so" all week.  I''ll try not to hold it against you.', '2002-11-05 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150811, 7809, 888, '<td valign="top">I had no idea what this was about, only by googling did I find out,</td>', 'I had no idea what this was about, only by googling did I find out,', '2002-11-05 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
