(150814, 7809, 51167, '<td valign="top">wow, two of these ones this week.  Those cookies are actually pretty good even though it''s not really a $250 recipe.  I like how you set this one up.</td>', 'wow, two of these ones this week.  Those cookies are actually pretty good even though it''s not really a $250 recipe.  I like how you set this one up.', '2002-11-06 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
