(150831, 7810, 3280, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do this all week, but couldn''t find a mirror I liked that I didn''t mind breaking.  Besides, I didn''t need 7 years bad!!  God job on the focus and direction.  How did it look in color?  DPz</td>', 'I wanted to do this all week, but couldn''t find a mirror I liked that I didn''t mind breaking.  Besides, I didn''t need 7 years bad!!  God job on the focus and direction.  How did it look in color?  DPz', '2002-11-04 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
