(150858, 7812, 4077, '<td valign="top">Hmm... doesn''t look like that particular birdy is going to be knocking on anything for quite some time. (Unless it''s fitted with a motor.) Good interpretation of the challenge though. seasick - 6.</td>', 'Hmm... doesn''t look like that particular birdy is going to be knocking on anything for quite some time. (Unless it''s fitted with a motor.) Good interpretation of the challenge though. seasick - 6.', '2002-11-04 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150859, 7812, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good shot and idea, I thought it was real for a while then looked closer.  Good job on the lighting and DOF. DPz</td>', 'Good shot and idea, I thought it was real for a while then looked closer.  Good job on the lighting and DOF. DPz', '2002-11-04 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150860, 7812, 4798, '<td valign="top">Is the bird real? It looks almost porcelain-like. It''s a good macro shot (slightly overexposed) but it doesn''t really relate to the theme of the challenge - apart from the title, I guess.</td>', 'Is the bird real? It looks almost porcelain-like. It''s a good macro shot (slightly overexposed) but it doesn''t really relate to the theme of the challenge - apart from the title, I guess.', '2002-11-05 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
