(150862, 7812, 4402, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2002-11-05 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150863, 7812, 3540, '<td valign="top">Better as a statue than a photo.  It''s taken pretty well, just not terribly interesting.  That was a tough one in this challenge though for lots of folks. - Inspzil</td>', 'Better as a statue than a photo.  It''s taken pretty well, just not terribly interesting.  That was a tough one in this challenge though for lots of folks. - Inspzil', '2002-11-07 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150864, 7812, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute fresh idea and good photograph but the bird looks fake.  Tell me if I''m wrong.  Tighter crop than I would like to have used.  5 for submitting photo; -2 for fake bird; +3 for fresh idea; -1 for crop;  +2 for clarity:  Gives you a very respectible 7.</td>', 'Cute fresh idea and good photograph but the bird looks fake.  Tell me if I''m wrong.  Tighter crop than I would like to have used.  5 for submitting photo; -2 for fake bird; +3 for fresh idea; -1 for crop;  +2 for clarity:  Gives you a very respectible 7.', '2002-11-07 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150865, 7812, 3982, '<td valign="top">had me fooled for a second...good for you.</td>', 'had me fooled for a second...good for you.', '2002-11-08 05:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150866, 7812, 1003, '<td valign="top">very nice detail.</td>', 'very nice detail.', '2002-11-08 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150867, 7812, 2764, '<td valign="top">He''s made of wood, right?  I have one just like him banging holes in my house.  How can I make him go away?  Every time he knocks the parrot answers "hello".<br/>But anyways. if this is a wooden woodpecker than you should have beeen able to improve the focus and the lighting to get the colors to stand out better,  the picture looks way washed out and drab.  Make his red top stand out.</td>', 'He''s made of wood, right?  I have one just like him banging holes in my house.  How can I make him go away?  Every time he knocks the parrot answers "hello".But anyways. if this is a wooden woodpecker than you should have beeen able to improve the focus and the lighting to get the colors to stand out better,  the picture looks way washed out and drab.  Make his red top stand out.', '2002-11-08 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150868, 7812, 4455, '<td valign="top">i like the wood detail-anz</td>', 'i like the wood detail-anz', '2002-11-10 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150869, 7816, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I would''ve pulled some petals off to better represent the superstition.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I would''ve pulled some petals off to better represent the superstition.', '2002-11-04 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150870, 7816, 3002, '<td valign="top">Superb, but I think I would have left the ''picked'' petal in the photo.  Superb nevertheless ~ 10!</td>', 'Superb, but I think I would have left the ''picked'' petal in the photo.  Superb nevertheless ~ 10!', '2002-11-04 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150871, 7816, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice Macro!  For the quality of the picture, I score you high because it is so well shot.  I think for the challenge, however, I think it would have had more impact if some of the petals were already picked off.  Just my own thought.  In any event, I really like the blue background.  It makes the white flower really stand out.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice Macro!  For the quality of the picture, I score you high because it is so well shot.  I think for the challenge, however, I think it would have had more impact if some of the petals were already picked off.  Just my own thought.  In any event, I really like the blue background.  It makes the white flower really stand out.  Nicely done.', '2002-11-04 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150872, 7816, 3380, '<td valign="top">would also make a great submission for this weeks challenge as well.</td>', 'would also make a great submission for this weeks challenge as well.', '2002-11-04 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150873, 7816, 3280, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot.  I love the colors and the focus is super.  It probably would have hit the challenge a bit better if you pulled a few of the petals though.  Good Job, you are ready for the Macro Challenge!! DPz</td>', 'A really nice shot.  I love the colors and the focus is super.  It probably would have hit the challenge a bit better if you pulled a few of the petals though.  Good Job, you are ready for the Macro Challenge!! DPz', '2002-11-04 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150874, 7816, 3506, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!  Bright, but not over-exposed.  (10)</td>', 'Excellent photo!  Bright, but not over-exposed.  (10)', '2002-11-04 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150875, 7816, 4829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, lighting, background and clarity. Would have been cool to have removed some of the petals, but I think that the thought is there anyway, good job!</td>', 'Beautiful photo, lighting, background and clarity. Would have been cool to have removed some of the petals, but I think that the thought is there anyway, good job!', '2002-11-04 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
