(150983, 7820, 1569, '<td valign="top">Good one!! Looks like it took a long time to carve.After the challenge I would like to see this in color.</td>', 'Good one!! Looks like it took a long time to carve.After the challenge I would like to see this in color.', '2002-11-04 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150984, 7820, 4798, '<td valign="top">Eeeek!</td>', 'Eeeek!', '2002-11-05 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150985, 7820, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice tones and contrast. <br/>seems a bit tilted.</td>', 'nice tones and contrast. seems a bit tilted.', '2002-11-06 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150986, 7820, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very cool carving.  Interesting shot.  nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'Very cool carving.  Interesting shot.  nice job - Inspzil', '2002-11-08 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150987, 7820, 1031, '<td valign="top">That looks like a lot of work! What''s it like in color?</td>', 'That looks like a lot of work! What''s it like in color?', '2002-11-09 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150988, 7820, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is surely a creepy fellow.  I like the lighting.  I might wanted to have seen the tilt corrected somehow, but I''m not sure really what that would require.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and focus seems nice as well.  Nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This is surely a creepy fellow.  I like the lighting.  I might wanted to have seen the tilt corrected somehow, but I''m not sure really what that would require.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and focus seems nice as well.  Nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-09 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(150989, 7820, 4648, '<td valign="top">I want to see this one with out the effects.  Just a plain old lights on sitting on the kitchen table picture.  This one has me buffaloed.  The carving itself is worth the 8.  Took someone some time to do this. So it rates a 9</td>', 'I want to see this one with out the effects.  Just a plain old lights on sitting on the kitchen table picture.  This one has me buffaloed.  The carving itself is worth the 8.  Took someone some time to do this. So it rates a 9', '2002-11-09 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
