(150993, 7821, 3459, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, the way the main line (formed by the shadow)  draws your eye towards the penie; and the two dark shadows (top and bottom) give the image more of a visual ease.  Congrats!</td>', 'I love the composition, the way the main line (formed by the shadow)  draws your eye towards the penie; and the two dark shadows (top and bottom) give the image more of a visual ease.  Congrats!', '2002-11-04 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
