(151006, 7821, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this laying on a drainage grate in the street?  Neet shot right down to texture being almost 3-D.  Even to the flaws on the penny.  Good 8.</td>', 'Is this laying on a drainage grate in the street?  Neet shot right down to texture being almost 3-D.  Even to the flaws on the penny.  Good 8.', '2002-11-10 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151007, 7822, 3540, '<td valign="top">Need the teeth to show up better.  I really had to look hard to see that''s what this was going for.  The lighting is pretty good, maybe a little bright.  The choice of chairs was not.  The reflection is too bright.  It is pretty good despite. - Inspzil</td>', 'Need the teeth to show up better.  I really had to look hard to see that''s what this was going for.  The lighting is pretty good, maybe a little bright.  The choice of chairs was not.  The reflection is too bright.  It is pretty good despite. - Inspzil', '2002-11-04 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151008, 7822, 4615, '<td valign="top">Should have used more makeup, like a heavy foundation.  Not because she isn''t pretty or anything, the acne on the forehead and spots and moles give her away as very much alive.  Blemish free ghost white skin would be more vampirish.    the eyes are great.  very dead looking.  good concept.</td>', 'Should have used more makeup, like a heavy foundation.  Not because she isn''t pretty or anything, the acne on the forehead and spots and moles give her away as very much alive.  Blemish free ghost white skin would be more vampirish.    the eyes are great.  very dead looking.  good concept.', '2002-11-04 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151009, 7822, 3317, '<td valign="top">for a vampire, this lady''s got some decent skin tone.</td>', 'for a vampire, this lady''s got some decent skin tone.', '2002-11-04 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151010, 7822, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL She''s a great model, really looks wasted. Neat shot. Good luck. Justine</td>', 'LOL She''s a great model, really looks wasted. Neat shot. Good luck. Justine', '2002-11-04 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151011, 7822, 3280, '<td valign="top">The eyes are great, I wish the glare wasn''t on the chair behind her though.  DPz</td>', 'The eyes are great, I wish the glare wasn''t on the chair behind her though.  DPz', '2002-11-04 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151012, 7822, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good job with the makeup :)<br/>The background could be a bit more interesting, but plain is also a good choice. <br/>8 - Konador</td>', 'Good job with the makeup :)The background could be a bit more interesting, but plain is also a good choice. 8 - Konador', '2002-11-05 03:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151013, 7822, 4596, '<td valign="top">Great look.</td>', 'Great look.', '2002-11-05 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151014, 7822, 4608, '<td valign="top">Very dumb and Gothy.</td>', 'Very dumb and Gothy.', '2002-11-06 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151015, 7822, 4266, '<td valign="top">Love this as I''m partial to the vampire myth.</td>', 'Love this as I''m partial to the vampire myth.', '2002-11-06 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151016, 7822, 472, '<td valign="top">coold have been cool but the lighting is not flattering to the model''s skin ..</td>', 'coold have been cool but the lighting is not flattering to the model''s skin ..', '2002-11-08 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151017, 7822, 3018, '<td valign="top">Although not taken under the best of circumstances, this picture manages to capture a perfect expression which transmits the depressing truth of a vampire''s inmortality.</td>', 'Although not taken under the best of circumstances, this picture manages to capture a perfect expression which transmits the depressing truth of a vampire''s inmortality.', '2002-11-08 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151018, 7822, 1255, '<td valign="top">It looks like she''s got those spiral contacts on!  I love those (and have a pair myself). Great idea for the challenge and well excuted</td>', 'It looks like she''s got those spiral contacts on!  I love those (and have a pair myself). Great idea for the challenge and well excuted', '2002-11-09 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151019, 7822, 4648, '<td valign="top">The idea takes a minute to register - you have to see that one tooth to catch it.  Before that the pimples and black heads catch your eye and turn you off.  I didn''t even see the eyes until about the third or forth close up look.  Photo wise it is fairly decent maybe a 5 - a little tightly cropped, a little too dark even for the subject it is, to dark a shadow on the other eye and neck.  But eye appeal, for me, knocks it down some.</td>', 'The idea takes a minute to register - you have to see that one tooth to catch it.  Before that the pimples and black heads catch your eye and turn you off.  I didn''t even see the eyes until about the third or forth close up look.  Photo wise it is fairly decent maybe a 5 - a little tightly cropped, a little too dark even for the subject it is, to dark a shadow on the other eye and neck.  But eye appeal, for me, knocks it down some.', '2002-11-09 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151020, 7823, 4536, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.<br/>the black object behind the cats rear bugs me though, too bad you couldn''t stamp it out :).</td>', 'interesting shot.the black object behind the cats rear bugs me though, too bad you couldn''t stamp it out :).', '2002-11-04 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151021, 7823, 2764, '<td valign="top">is it on your car?  what is the little do dad?  Sure is a black cat.  I like the silouette and the shadow, not sure about the other stufff like the bubbles on the left and the whatever it is on the right (doorjam?) -8</td>', 'is it on your car?  what is the little do dad?  Sure is a black cat.  I like the silouette and the shadow, not sure about the other stufff like the bubbles on the left and the whatever it is on the right (doorjam?) -8', '2002-11-04 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151022, 7823, 1019, '<td valign="top">I really like this  andrewm</td>', 'I really like this  andrewm', '2002-11-04 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151023, 7823, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2002-11-04 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
