(151042, 7824, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the lines on the wall.  They ruin the whole thing.  Why is everyone cropping so closely.  That makes me crop my scores too.  Cropped you down to a 5</td>', 'Don''t like the lines on the wall.  They ruin the whole thing.  Why is everyone cropping so closely.  That makes me crop my scores too.  Cropped you down to a 5', '2002-11-10 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
