(151082, 7828, 2003, '<td valign="top">PTL, if i''d know that i could score a point for every cat, i certainly would''ve put in a lot more! either that or just shoot some wire sculptures completely off topic - that was good for a higher score, wasn''t it? <br/>yes, the cat is a picture, but it''s not a black cat - it''s an orange cat - inverted (the brown bg was originally kind of gun-metal blue) with his real eyes and nose layered in - did you know that if you''re trying to get a nicely broken mirror, you can''t just lay it on the ground and drop a billiard ball on it?  they make glass pretty tough these days - i finally had to whack it with a hammer - arranged the cat photo over the mirror - 2 lights: 1 for the cat and 1 for the mirror</td>', 'PTL, if i''d know that i could score a point for every cat, i certainly would''ve put in a lot more! either that or just shoot some wire sculptures completely off topic - that was good for a higher score, wasn''t it? yes, the cat is a picture, but it''s not a black cat - it''s an orange cat - inverted (the brown bg was originally kind of gun-metal blue) with his real eyes and nose layered in - did you know that if you''re trying to get a nicely broken mirror, you can''t just lay it on the ground and drop a billiard ball on it?  they make glass pretty tough these days - i finally had to whack it with a hammer - arranged the cat photo over the mirror - 2 lights: 1 for the cat and 1 for the mirror', '2002-11-11 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
