(151101, 7830, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- great lighting and color on the apple, wonderful black background.<br/>composition -- taking a bite of the apple was a nice touch ... not too thrilled that that bit of the apple is already going brown (i''m guessing you took a lot of photos to get this shot just right :)  i like the medication in the background being blurry, just wondering if you have another shot where the containers are just a touch less blurry and how that worked.  overall good shot  :)<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- great lighting and color on the apple, wonderful black background.composition -- taking a bite of the apple was a nice touch ... not too thrilled that that bit of the apple is already going brown (i''m guessing you took a lot of photos to get this shot just right :)  i like the medication in the background being blurry, just wondering if you have another shot where the containers are just a touch less blurry and how that worked.  overall good shot  :)-- gr8photos', '2002-11-05 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
