(151139, 7833, 4648, '<td valign="top">Now that it has finally opened I see it clearly and it is a true 10.  I don''t know what anyone did to get it to open, but thank you so much.  It is beautiful.  Color is fantastic and the texture of the skin is so clear. right sown to the light scar on the left thumb and the red spot at the base of the rigtht thumb.    I like the table .  Only thing wrong for me, even though I understand why you did it, I would have liked to have it show a little more of the person''s hand.  So glad I could correct my score</td>', 'Now that it has finally opened I see it clearly and it is a true 10.  I don''t know what anyone did to get it to open, but thank you so much.  It is beautiful.  Color is fantastic and the texture of the skin is so clear. right sown to the light scar on the left thumb and the red spot at the base of the rigtht thumb.    I like the table .  Only thing wrong for me, even though I understand why you did it, I would have liked to have it show a little more of the person''s hand.  So glad I could correct my score', '2002-11-09 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
