(151163, 7836, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- slight pixelation, lighting a little uneven (light at the bottom of the photo).  otherwise fine.<br/>composition -- i like the mask, and the mouse is a nice touch.  i think you could have controlled your background a little more.  take the picture in front of a plain wall or hang up a large piece of plain cloth as a backdrop.  the door frame and hinge is distracting and your photo isn''t quite level (something that wouldn''t be noticable with a plain blackdrop).<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- slight pixelation, lighting a little uneven (light at the bottom of the photo).  otherwise fine.composition -- i like the mask, and the mouse is a nice touch.  i think you could have controlled your background a little more.  take the picture in front of a plain wall or hang up a large piece of plain cloth as a backdrop.  the door frame and hinge is distracting and your photo isn''t quite level (something that wouldn''t be noticable with a plain blackdrop).-- gr8photos', '2002-11-05 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
