(151220, 7839, 3018, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone that took the time to vote and comment on my picture.  Just to explain to some that commented on this, the alien is specifically not quite in focus and with the bright backlight to make it more mysterious.  After all, when have you seen a clear and on focus picture of an alien or UFO?  The elements I used to take this picture was a 1 inch plastic alien (which also appeared on my Fruits &amp; Vegetables picture) standing on a dark blue towel and lighted with a small flashlight.  The B&amp;W was done with Photoshop.  The title I chose was not my first option, but I thought that something more dramatic like "The Truth is out there" was going to be used by someone else on the challenge.  Thanks again to all of you.</td>', 'Thanks everyone that took the time to vote and comment on my picture.  Just to explain to some that commented on this, the alien is specifically not quite in focus and with the bright backlight to make it more mysterious.  After all, when have you seen a clear and on focus picture of an alien or UFO?  The elements I used to take this picture was a 1 inch plastic alien (which also appeared on my Fruits & Vegetables picture) standing on a dark blue towel and lighted with a small flashlight.  The B&W was done with Photoshop.  The title I chose was not my first option, but I thought that something more dramatic like "The Truth is out there" was going to be used by someone else on the challenge.  Thanks again to all of you.', '2002-11-11 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(151221, 7839, 4610, '<td valign="top">Felicidades Jenaro!! Muchas de estas....</td>', 'Felicidades Jenaro!! Muchas de estas....', '2002-11-11 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(151222, 7840, 4297, '<td valign="top">13.. very good..  7</td>', '13.. very good..  7', '2002-11-04 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151223, 7840, 2792, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the supersition/urban legend is here.  Can''t say I''m a gambler. Let me know what it is!  It''s still a great photo though.  7/10, will raise when I hear supersition. =-)  erin_m02</td>', 'Not sure what the supersition/urban legend is here.  Can''t say I''m a gambler. Let me know what it is!  It''s still a great photo though.  7/10, will raise when I hear supersition. =-)  erin_m02', '2002-11-04 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151224, 7840, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot....  I would personally like it better photographed at an angle rather than straight on... It would give some three dimensional characteristics to the dice and keep the image from appearing flat... - setzler</td>', 'Interesting shot....  I would personally like it better photographed at an angle rather than straight on... It would give some three dimensional characteristics to the dice and keep the image from appearing flat... - setzler', '2002-11-04 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
