(151274, 7844, 4293, '<td valign="top">As far as spilt salt goes, this is my fave.  I like the shapes, textures and the fact that it''s on a believable surface for the event.</td>', 'As far as spilt salt goes, this is my fave.  I like the shapes, textures and the fact that it''s on a believable surface for the event.', '2002-11-06 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
