(151276, 7844, 4648, '<td valign="top">I believe there is more to this than meets the eye.  The "wooden " salt shaker(which I don''t think is a salt shaker at all, just a solid piece of wood painted to look like one); the blue table top with terrible paint streaks(A very obvious lousy paint job);  spilt salt that doesn''t look like table salt at all;  and what looks like a cocktail glass with a white ball under the base with a strong shadow of the stem.  Photo<br/>wise  (quality) it is at least a 6 but I''m not sure at all about anything else.  Don''t feel I can give more than a 5 total.  But then that is a good score.  Doesn''t take much more to be #1.</td>', 'I believe there is more to this than meets the eye.  The "wooden " salt shaker(which I don''t think is a salt shaker at all, just a solid piece of wood painted to look like one); the blue table top with terrible paint streaks(A very obvious lousy paint job);  spilt salt that doesn''t look like table salt at all;  and what looks like a cocktail glass with a white ball under the base with a strong shadow of the stem.  Photowise  (quality) it is at least a 6 but I''m not sure at all about anything else.  Don''t feel I can give more than a 5 total.  But then that is a good score.  Doesn''t take much more to be #1.', '2002-11-08 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151277, 7844, 3031, '<td valign="top">Not very original.</td>', 'Not very original.', '2002-11-09 06:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
