(151316, 7847, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ll tell you what amazesme about this photo - light in the "eye" hole and light coming "out the top" but NO light showing up anywhere else in any other openings in the skull.  Don''t know it that was intentional or not, but it blows my mind to the point of a 7.  Guess you can see how small my mind is.</td>', 'I''ll tell you what amazesme about this photo - light in the "eye" hole and light coming "out the top" but NO light showing up anywhere else in any other openings in the skull.  Don''t know it that was intentional or not, but it blows my mind to the point of a 7.  Guess you can see how small my mind is.', '2002-11-05 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
