(151325, 7848, 4615, '<td valign="top">Good idea, only I would suggest having the razor inbeded in the apple.  here it looks like it is merely placed on a half slice.</td>', 'Good idea, only I would suggest having the razor inbeded in the apple.  here it looks like it is merely placed on a half slice.', '2002-11-04 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151326, 7848, 4049, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this, when I saw Oprah on friday and she talked out how this never happened.</td>', 'I thought about doing this, when I saw Oprah on friday and she talked out how this never happened.', '2002-11-04 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151327, 7848, 1827, '<td valign="top">The background color selection here is a good one, somehow it makes me feel all antiseptic and creepy - makes me imagine the environment where a creep might actually DO something like this.  I wish though that the apple were "just-cut fresh"; I guess you worked with it for a little while.  For me the dulled white is too close to the color of the background.  Also, I think it would be more effective if the focus here were RAZOR sharp.  5, just-married</td>', 'The background color selection here is a good one, somehow it makes me feel all antiseptic and creepy - makes me imagine the environment where a creep might actually DO something like this.  I wish though that the apple were "just-cut fresh"; I guess you worked with it for a little while.  For me the dulled white is too close to the color of the background.  Also, I think it would be more effective if the focus here were RAZOR sharp.  5, just-married', '2002-11-04 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151328, 7848, 4077, '<td valign="top">Nice and original interpretation of the challenge. The image itself is pretty sound as well. (Would have been better on a plain white background.) seasick - 7.</td>', 'Nice and original interpretation of the challenge. The image itself is pretty sound as well. (Would have been better on a plain white background.) seasick - 7.', '2002-11-04 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
