(151343, 7848, 3080, '<td valign="top">Ugh, our local school checks halloween treats for ''stuff'' and found quite a bit of bad things.  So I wonder if this is an urban legend, or a fact.  Either way, Im giving all the benefit of the doubt this week, so the technical part...The focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  a very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Ugh, our local school checks halloween treats for ''stuff'' and found quite a bit of bad things.  So I wonder if this is an urban legend, or a fact.  Either way, Im giving all the benefit of the doubt this week, so the technical part...The focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  a very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-09 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
