(151367, 7849, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t particularly go for the red in these pictures.  Just personal.  I do notice there are a lot of them.  And I''ll be honest this does tend to make me vote lower than I probably would otherwise.  Don''t know why you cropped so closely and made it all so dark.  Would have liked a little more of it and more light.  But it does show good texture to the body.  I like that.  Overall, even with lowering because of the red I still give it a 6.</td>', 'I don''t particularly go for the red in these pictures.  Just personal.  I do notice there are a lot of them.  And I''ll be honest this does tend to make me vote lower than I probably would otherwise.  Don''t know why you cropped so closely and made it all so dark.  Would have liked a little more of it and more light.  But it does show good texture to the body.  I like that.  Overall, even with lowering because of the red I still give it a 6.', '2002-11-10 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
