(151419, 7854, 4100, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! You are an early beneficiary of my new "make me laugh out loud, win a bonus point" voting policy. The background seems a bit distracting - perhaps a smaller depth of field would have helped? But then, fur can be a real pain to shoot with a limited depth of field.</td>', 'Congratulations! You are an early beneficiary of my new "make me laugh out loud, win a bonus point" voting policy. The background seems a bit distracting - perhaps a smaller depth of field would have helped? But then, fur can be a real pain to shoot with a limited depth of field.', '2002-11-05 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
