(151424, 7854, 2764, '<td valign="top">He needs mor light on the front of him.  He isn''t so well situated against his background and is the focus off or intentionally "soft"?  His eyeballs seem to be the focal point of the picture but they are too far off center towards the top.  Reframing with rule of thirds. maybe brightening the white of the eyes and lightening the furry blue might help. 5</td>', 'He needs mor light on the front of him.  He isn''t so well situated against his background and is the focus off or intentionally "soft"?  His eyeballs seem to be the focal point of the picture but they are too far off center towards the top.  Reframing with rule of thirds. maybe brightening the white of the eyes and lightening the furry blue might help. 5', '2002-11-08 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
