(151455, 7857, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is not funny.  I''ve lost loved ones to this.  I pray this doesn''t strike your family.  Looks like you accomplished pretty much what you set out to when you started.  Don''t really understand why this message in a ring box.  Good focus with a mystical lighting overall.  Needs a little more light.  Don''t see the legend or superstition.  Emotion wise I''d like to give a 1, meeting challenge also is a 1 as far as I''m concerned, picture wise though it is about a 6, which gives it a final 4</td>', 'This is not funny.  I''ve lost loved ones to this.  I pray this doesn''t strike your family.  Looks like you accomplished pretty much what you set out to when you started.  Don''t really understand why this message in a ring box.  Good focus with a mystical lighting overall.  Needs a little more light.  Don''t see the legend or superstition.  Emotion wise I''d like to give a 1, meeting challenge also is a 1 as far as I''m concerned, picture wise though it is about a 6, which gives it a final 4', '2002-11-09 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
