(151599, 7866, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is really a superstition, as it is a belief or tradition.   I guess it just depends on which side of the fence you''re on, so I''ll just comment on the technical aspects.  I think the focus is great.  Lighting is also very nice, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I might say I wish I could see more of the fortune, but it still gets the point across nicely.  Overall a great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Not sure if this is really a superstition, as it is a belief or tradition.   I guess it just depends on which side of the fence you''re on, so I''ll just comment on the technical aspects.  I think the focus is great.  Lighting is also very nice, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I might say I wish I could see more of the fortune, but it still gets the point across nicely.  Overall a great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-09 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
