(223069, 7863, 6771, '<td valign="top">After reading all the comments, it comes to me that there are many different types of people here.  One thing I am seeing is, alot of people go on the merit of the photo (technical, etc.), while others only go on a moral issue.  I agree with it being a little dark, but it being in the superstitions challenge...PERFECT, because that is what it is.  To me, if it causes a little emotion, along with being a good photo...I like it even  more!  I''d given ya a seven!!